red design processes using empathy-driven methodologies. Use when the user says &quot;lets run design thinking&quot; or &quot;I want to apply design thinking&quot;</description>\n    <location>/Users/steve/.agents/skills/bmad-cis-design-thinking/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bmad-cis-innovation-strategy</name>\n    <description>Identify disruption opportunities and architect business model innovation. Use when the user says &quot;lets create an innovation strategy&quot; or &quot;I want to find disruption opportunities&quot;</description>\n    <location>/Users/steve/.agents/skills/bmad-cis-innovation-strategy/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bmad-cis-problem-solving</name>\n    <description>Apply systematic problem-solving methodologies to complex challenges. Use when the user says &quot;guide me through structured problem solving&quot; or &quot;I want to crack this challenge with guided problem solving techniques&quot;</description>\n    <location>/Users/steve/.agents/skills/bmad-cis-problem-solving/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bmad-cis-storytelling</name>\n    <description>Craft compelling narratives using story frameworks. Use when the user says &quot;help me with storytelling&quot; or &quot;I want to create a narrative through storytelling&quot;</description>\n    <location>/Users/steve/.agents/skills/bmad-cis-storytelling/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bmad-code-review</name>\n    <description>Review code changes with several independent reviewers in parallel, then triage and present the findings. Use when the user says &quot;run code review&quot; or &quot;review this code&quot;</description>\n    <location>/Users/steve/.agents/skills/bmad-code-review/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>bmad-correct-course</name>\n    <description>Assess the impact of a significant change during sprint execution across the PRD, epics, architecture, and UX documents, and